---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Our Services
permalink: /our-services/
description: "Psychiatric medication management and psychotherapy for children, teens, and adults across Washington State, and the conditions we treat."
---
<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="container">
    <h1 class="page-title">Our Services</h1>
    <p class="page-hero__sub">Medication management and psychotherapy for children (8+), teens, and adults, by secure video anywhere in Washington.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--light" id="approach">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head">
      <p class="eyebrow">Our approach</p>
      <h2>Care that looks at the whole person</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="card-grid card-grid--3">
      <article class="card">
        <span class="card__icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-file-medical" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
        <h3>Evidence Based Medicine</h3>
        <p>We aim to use evidence-based medicine to guide us in collaborating with you when arriving at a suitable medication regimen for your psychiatric needs. In certain cases, medications may not be indicated, and we can discuss the clinical decision making process and other supports.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <span class="card__icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-hand-holding-medical" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
        <h3>Tailored Treatment Regimens</h3>
        <p>We address your mental health needs from multiple angles, including medication management, individual psychotherapy, drawing on social supports and resources, and recommendations for somatic therapies and alternative medicine modalities if applicable.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <span class="card__icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-laptop-medical" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
        <h3>Secure Telehealth</h3>
        <p>Appointments take place over a secure, HIPAA-compliant video platform. Attend from a private location without commuting, sitting in a waiting room, or rearranging your entire day around an office visit.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--tight">
  <div class="container service-boxes">
    <div class="service-box" id="medication">
      <img src="/images/2020/05/online-talk.webp" alt="" class="service-box__icon">
      <h2>Medication Management</h2>
      <ul class="checklist">
        <li>Personalized psychiatric medication regimen</li>
        <li>Evidence based medicine</li>
        <li>Continuous assessment of medication needs</li>
        <li>Monitoring for side effects, drug interactions and efficacy of psychiatric medication</li>
        <li>Goals for time limited medication use where appropriate</li>
        <li>Minimizing risks of polypharmacy</li>
        <li>Considerations around deprescribing</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="service-box" id="psychotherapy">
      <img src="/images/2020/05/online-phone.webp" alt="" class="service-box__icon">
      <h2>Psychotherapy</h2>
      <ul class="checklist">
        <li>Judgement free and confidential</li>
        <li>Goal directed</li>
        <li>Psychoanalytic and supportive approach</li>
        <li>Nurturing environment</li>
        <li>Direct communication style</li>
        <li>Focus on personal and interpersonal growth</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>


<section class="section section--navy" id="conditions">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head">
      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow--light">Integrative approach</p>
      <h2>Conditions we treat</h2>
      <p class="section-head__sub">We treat a wide range of conditions for patients age 8 and up.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="condition-grid">
      {%- for s in specialties %}
      <div class="condition">
        <i class="{{ s.icon }}" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        <div>
          <h3>{{ s.title }}</h3>
          <p>{{ s.text }}</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--tight">
  <div class="container center">
    <p class="eyebrow">Psychotherapy</p>
    <h2>Special interests in psychotherapy</h2>
    <p class="section-head__sub">Dr. Qureshi's integrative approach to identity and culture, family and parenting, money, spirituality, life transitions, and more.</p>
    <div class="btn-row btn-row--center" style="margin-top: 20px;"><a href="/service/" class="btn btn--lg">See all special interests</a></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--tight section--light">
  <div class="container center">
    <p class="eyebrow">Serving Bellevue, Kirkland, Issaquah, Mercer Island, Newcastle &amp; Renton</p>
    <h2>Care on the Eastside</h2>
    <nav class="quick-links" aria-label="Eastside care topics">
      {%- for p in collections.eastside | sort(false, false, "data.order") %}
      <a href="{{ p.url }}">{{ p.data.navLabel }}</a>
      {%- endfor %}
    </nav>
  </div>
</section>
